s=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years, more than any other pair. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 33% of normal in August to September and 36% in September to October. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 172% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 24761 had its driest year in 1988 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
